{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "framework": null,
  "buildCommand": null,
  "outputDirectory": ".",
  "cleanUrls": false,
  "trailingSlash": false,
  "headers": [
    {
      "comment": "Kerangka aplikasi WAJIB boleh berubah kapan saja. Kalau ikut disimpan lama, pengguna terjebak di versi lama dan tidak ada cara memperbaikinya dari jauh.",
      "source": "/(index.html|sw.js|manifest.webmanifest)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" }]
    },
    {
      "comment": "Kode dan materi: selalu tanya dulu ke server. Pekerja layanan sudah punya cadangan luringnya sendiri, jadi ini tidak mengurangi kemampuan offline.",
      "source": "/(js|data)/(.*)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" }]
    },
    {
      "source": "/assets/css/(.*)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" }]
    },
    {
      "comment": "Gambar, ikon, dan huruf jarang berubah dan namanya stabil.",
      "source": "/assets/(merek|icon)(.*)",
      "headers": [{ "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=604800" }]
    },
    {
      "comment": "Pengamanan dasar. Tidak ada kerangka tersemat, tidak ada penebakan tipe berkas, dan alamat halaman tidak bocor ke situs lain.",
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "DENY" },
        { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" },
        { "key": "Permissions-Policy", "value": "camera=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
